      "statement": "The WebSocket server entrypoint servers/websocket/src/index.ts reads WEBSOCKET_HOST (default 0.0.0.0) and WEBSOCKET_PORT (default 8787) and constructs the server via createWebSocketServer; presence is cleared on socket close and pending requests are cleaned up per-socket on disconnect.",
