      "statement": "The MCP server is exposed over MCP Streamable HTTP (endpoint /mcp by default) and is the default runtime; its entrypoint servers/mcp/src/index.ts runs the HTTP runtime from http-server.ts, and the transport-neutral server factory is createBrijioMcpServer in mcp-server.ts.",
