      "id": "claim_a131c375740340979514433b47d3b295",
      "statement": "The MCP HTTP boundary requires a separate bearer token MCP_HTTP_AUTH_TOKEN (distinct from the Brijio pairing token), validates Host and Origin headers, is stateless (each request constructs and tears down an MCP server instance and stores no page content, URLs, or action results), and refuses to start without MCP_HTTP_AUTH_TOKEN.",
      "evidence": [
